#### **`&-why` 섹션** (622~741줄) — 수직 스킬 리스트 + 비디오 프리뷰

```scss
&__skill-list {
  width: 100%;
  text-align: center;
}

&__skill-item {
  position: relative;
  padding: fluid(10, 24) 0;
  cursor: default;
  transition: opacity var(--transition-base);
}

&__preview {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: fluid(24, 56);
  width: fluid(320, 560);
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  clip-path: inset(50% 0 50% 0);

  &.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    clip-path: inset(0% 0 0% 0);
  }
}
```

